<https://ptpge.org/v1/printing/management/quality-assurance/color-management/adobe-color-management> a skos:Concept ;
    dcterms:created "2026-05-18T12:24:03+00:00"^^xsd:dateTime ;
    dcterms:creator "https://ptpge.org/contributors/ptpge" ;
    dcterms:isReplacedBy <https://ptpge.org/v1/printing/management/quality-assurance/color-management> ;
    dcterms:license <https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/> ;
    dcterms:modified "2026-10-06T19:29:35+00:00"^^xsd:dateTime ;
    skos:altLabel "Adobe Colour Management"@en ;
    skos:broader <https://ptpge.org/v1/printing/management/quality-assurance/color-management> ;
    skos:definition "Adobes farvestyringsramme integreret i Photoshop, Illustrator, InDesign og Acrobat — håndterer tildeling af ICC-profiler, konvertering og soft-proofing på tværs af Creative Suite."@da,
        "Adobes Farbmanagement-Framework, integriert in Photoshop, Illustrator, InDesign und Acrobat — verwaltet die Zuweisung, Konvertierung und Soft-Proof-Vorschau von ICC-Profilen über die Creative Suite hinweg."@de,
        "Adobe's color management framework integrated into Photoshop, Illustrator, InDesign, and Acrobat — handles ICC profile assignment, conversion, and soft-proofing across the Creative Suite."@en,
        "Sistema de gestión de color integrado en las aplicaciones Adobe Creative Cloud, basado en perfiles ICC y configuraciones de color compartidas entre Photoshop, Illustrator, InDesign y Acrobat."@es,
        "Photoshop, Illustrator, InDesign और Acrobat में एकीकृत Adobe का रंग प्रबंधन ढाँचा — पूरी Creative Suite में ICC प्रोफ़ाइल असाइनमेंट, रूपांतरण और सॉफ़्ट-प्रूफ़िंग संभालता है।"@hi,
        "Photoshop、Illustrator、InDesign、Acrobatに統合されたAdobeのカラーマネジメントフレームワーク — Creative Suite全体にわたるICCプロファイルの割り当て、変換、ソフトプルーフを処理する。"@ja,
        "Adobes fargestyrings-rammeverk integrert i Photoshop, Illustrator, InDesign og Acrobat — håndterer ICC-profiltildeling, konvertering og soft-proofing på tvers av Creative Suite."@nb,
        "Adobes kleurbeheerraamwerk, geïntegreerd in Photoshop, Illustrator, InDesign en Acrobat — verzorgt ICC-profieltoewijzing, conversie en soft-proofing door de hele Creative Suite."@nl,
        "Framework zarządzania barwą Adobe zintegrowany z Photoshopem, Illustratorem, InDesignem i Acrobatem — obsługuje przypisywanie profili ICC, konwersję i soft-proofing w całym pakiecie Creative Suite."@pl,
        "Quadro de gerenciamento de cor da Adobe integrado ao Photoshop, Illustrator, InDesign e Acrobat — trata atribuição de perfil ICC, conversão e prova de tela em toda a Creative Suite."@pt,
        "Adobes färghanteringsramverk integrerat i Photoshop, Illustrator, InDesign och Acrobat — hanterar tilldelning av ICC-profiler, konvertering och skärmprovtryck genom hela Creative Suite."@sv,
        "集成在Adobe Creative Cloud应用程序中的色彩管理系统，基于ICC配置文件和Photoshop、Illustrator、InDesign及Acrobat之间共享的色彩设置。"@zh-Hans ;
    skos:inScheme <https://ptpge.org/v1/scheme> ;
    skos:notation "P:MG§ADOBE-COLOR-MANAGEMENT" ;
    skos:prefLabel "Adobe Color Management"@da,
        "Adobe Color Management"@de,
